  "name": "colibri-core",
  "full_name": "proycon/colibri-core",
  "description": "Colibri core is an NLP tool as well as a C++ and Python library for working with basic linguistic constructions such as n-grams and skipgrams (i.e patterns with one or more gaps, either of fixed or dynamic size) in a quick and memory-efficient way. At the core is the tool ``colibri-patternmodeller`` whi      ch allows you to build, view, manipulate and query pattern models. ",
  "description_ja": "Colibri coreはNLPツールであり、n-gramやスキップグラム（固定・可変サイズのギャップを持つパターン）などの基本的な言語構造を高速かつメモリ効率よく扱うC++・Pythonライブラリ。中核ツール`colibri-patternmodeller`でパターンモデルの構築・表示・操作・クエリが可能",
  "url": "https://github.com/proycon/colibri-core",
